abstract: >-
  Python package to check, before combining Sentinel-2 L2A from Google Earth
  Engine and Microsoft Planetary Computer, whether both catalogues hold the
  same scenes and the same L2A generation, and how much monthly medians and
  annual composites of NDVI, EVI and NDWI change with the scene universe.
